# Pip artifacts
4.2.0

# Local archive
README_ORIGINAL.md

# Local agent session config — but skills and commands are shared repo config,
# not local state. .claude/ itself stays tracked-able so the negations work.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/commands/

# 2026-07-25: EXP_009 artifact regeneration (issue #25). These specific regenerated
# outputs MUST be committed — the March originals were lost precisely because they
# were local-only. Negations below override the `_DATA/` and `*.pt` rules above.
!experiments/_DATA/
experiments/_DATA/*
!experiments/_DATA/EXP_009/
experiments/_DATA/EXP_009/*
!experiments/_DATA/EXP_009/009bFIX_head_loop_results.pt
!experiments/_DATA/EXP_009/009bFIX_convergence_grid.pt
!experiments/_DATA/EXP_009/009c_spectral_data.pt
!experiments/_DATA/EXP_009/009c_validation_grid.pt
!experiments/_DATA/EXP_009/009a2_layer_scan_results.pt

# 2026-07-26: sink_geometry ATR trajectories. Same rule as EXP_009 above —
# outputs are committed so the masking analysis can be re-run without a sweep.
!experiments/sink_geometry/output/trajectories.pt

# 2026-07-31: noise re-run live log. Transient and timing-stamped; the committed
# deliverables for this experiment are results.pt and report.md (caveat 18 repair).
experiments/noise_rerun/output/run.log

# 2026-07-31: run 17's archive. Same rule as EXP_009 above: the matched-nu noise
# baseline's per-trial results (terminal tensors + per-iteration float64 metrics)
# are the caveat 18 repair's evidence and must survive the container.
!experiments/noise_rerun/output/results.pt

# 2026-08-01: renorm probes (#112). Same rule: per-prompt engine results with
# per-iteration metrics are the probes' evidence and must survive the container.
!experiments/renorm_probe/output/free_norm_results.pt
!experiments/renorm_probe/output/natural_arm_results.pt

# 2026-08-02: nu-sweep (#113). Same rule: the assembled per-trial archives are
# the sweep's evidence and must survive the container. The per-trial checkpoint
# files stay ignored: they are the resume unit, duplicated into the archive.
!experiments/nu_sweep/output/stage_a_results.pt
!experiments/nu_sweep/output/stage_b_results.pt
experiments/nu_sweep/output/checkpoints/

# 2026-08-02: local GPT-2 weights downloaded from the legacy S3 mirror for
# offline loading (ATR_GPT2_LOCAL). Ephemeral, rebuilt per container.
gpt2_local/

# 2026-08-06: turn attribution (#119). Same rule: per-pass share archives and
# the fresh stage-C gated runs are the probe's evidence and must survive the
# container.
!experiments/head_turn/output/turn_results.pt
!experiments/head_turn/output/plain_gated_results.pt
